# CODEOWNERS does not inherit from UIBC/.github - that file only covers the
# repositories GitHub treats as inheritable community health files, and this is
# not one of them. So each repository carries its own copy.
#
# Until the ruleset on the default branch is told to require a code-owner
# review, this file documents who owns review rather than enforcing it. The
# repository has one maintainer; a rule that requires an approval nobody else
# can give would stop work rather than slow it down.
